# textured.part -- A drafted block, its sides textured to VDI 3400 REF 30
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The sides lean 5 degrees, more than the 3 that the texture needs.
materials materials
profile p along z 0 0 0 40 0 0 40 20 0 0 20 0
extrude blk from 0 to 10 p draft 5
finish vdi30 blk.side
